[{"client_msg_id":"FD3CF4EE-C568-4849-B827-C8826AFCCC0F","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"なので変数にjsで代入ではなく関数に差分を渡してextendみたいなのが良さそう。それならc側の処理になりますしね。まあその辺は最適化の話だと思ったので、先のPRには入れてません","ts":"1626916342.206600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wu=nk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6B42357F-9AFB-4C54-9A10-BED87E3F92D1","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"json変換とrpc通信は比較的重めの処理になるので","ts":"1626916271.204800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pZWl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F4607A81-BE90-4FAE-B4C7-FCDAF3714897","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"js側で全要素保持してますが差分だけ送る形の方が効率いいと思います","ts":"1626916244.204100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RFpY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52a1911a-e345-4012-a884-8b7691abedae","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"確認します","ts":"1626916017.203300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QBv"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U022K4QMWTG","text":"\u003c@U022K4QMWTG\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1626914189.203000","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"ea774422-b856-4aea-8075-00026d46ecfa","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003c@U7JL1UKKL\u003e \u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/ddc.vim/pull/14\u003e 雑ですが書いてみました。中の仕組みとか分かってない（`completePos` ってなんじゃ？とか）で書いているので「こんな感じ」程度のイメージだと考えてください。","ts":"1626887073.202700","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/ddc.vim/pull/14|#14 EXAMPLE: Use `ReadableStream` as an interface of source\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/ddc.vim/pull/14|#14 EXAMPLE: Use `ReadableStream` as an interface of source\u003e","text":"This is not perfect while I don't really understand the core concept of ddc so do not merge it directly (e.g. I don't think I properly handle `completePos` in this PR)\n\n• Use `ReadableStream` as an interface of the source so that developers can define an incremental (gradual) asynchronous source\n• Use `TransformStream` as like `map` and `filter` function of an array so that candidates are incrementally (gradually) proceeded\n• Use `WritableStream` as a target of entire streams so that changes are incrementally (gradually) applied to Vim\n\nThese streams are defined well so you'll be able to use some common tools like \u003chttps://github.com/MeirionHughes/web-streams-extensions|https://github.com/MeirionHughes/web-streams-extensions\u003e (it does not support Deno though) in the future.\n\nRelated \u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/ddc.vim/pull/13|#13\u003e","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/ddc.vim|Shougo/ddc.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1626887010}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZGy50"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u003c@UFHQ7TNT0\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1626883694.201600","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"fc253ee9-748a-4444-8ad1-bd67106196d6","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私はむしろ \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; 使いまくってますね\n\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; のexpertになりたい","ts":"1626882524.201200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xg/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b17db682-767d-4f54-ba2b-000acb6a9f09","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"シンプルにこういう形で提供することにしました\nみなさん、アドバイスありがとうございましたm(_ _)m\n```augroup docker-custom-command\n  au!\n  au FileType docker-containers nnoremap \u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt; \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; T :